#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/terraform.rst:10
msgid ""
"In order to see the Terraform App Blueprint type option and create "
"Terraform App Blueprints in |LibBluApp|, the |morpheus| user must have "
"Role permissions for `Provisioning: Blueprints - Terraform` set to "
"`Full`."
